{"parentUuid":"3b11280f-73d6-4cad-a50d-d2eddbcbe76d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfo9SVPUdAN4zwN5WH8XS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes. I found 6 duplicate skills and removed them.\n\n**What I found:**\n- 6 skills in `~/.claude/skills/` had the same name as a plugin skill. They were `code-review`, `grilling`, `handoff`, `prototype`, `teach` and `watch`.\n- Each one was an old copy from July, just a link to a folder in `~/.agents/skills/`.\n- 5 were already turned off, so they did nothing.\n- 1 was still on: `code-review`. It was an old copy of Matt's code-review skill. It also clashed with the built-in `/code-review` command.\n\n**What I did:**\n- I removed the 6 links. This follows your rule: when a plugin and a local skill have the same name, the plugin wins.\n- The plugin versions stay: Matt's plugin 1.3.1 and the `watch` plugin 0.3.2.\n- The real folders are still in `~/.agents/skills/`, so Codex and Pi still have them. To undo, recreate a link, for example `ln -s ../../.agents/skills/grilling ~/.claude/skills/grilling`.\n- The skills git repo shows no changes, because these links were never in git. Nothing to commit.\n\n**Not duplicates (no action):**\n- `context-mode` shows 3 times. The extra 2 are setup files for other tools, inside the same plugin.\n- Some skills overlap in purpose but have different names:\n  - `superpowers:systematic-debugging` and `mattpocock-skills:diagnosing-bugs`\n  - `superpowers:test-driven-development` and `mattpocock-skills:tdd`\n  - Four ways to review code: the built-in `/code-review`, `mattpocock-skills:code-review`, `superpowers:requesting-code-review` and `codex-review`\n\nThose overlaps are a \"which one do I like\" choice. Tell me if you want to trim them.\n\n**What you do now:** Restart Claude Code."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1506,"cache_read_input_tokens":92013,"output_tokens":653,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":16},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1506,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":653,"cache_read_input_tokens":92013,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1506,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1506},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfo9SUwSSS2f4pLVv6vNQ","type":"assistant","uuid":"4e09892d-de7d-43cf-97b4-deb43ed1ab27","timestamp":"2026-10-07T15:53:30.938Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4a9c3d55-7061-46f7-9760-4b5eacc869c5","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"4a9c3d55-7061-46f7-9760-4b5eacc869c5","version":"2.1.292","gitBranch":"main"}
