{"parentUuid":"bf698983-d303-4221-8033-bff417590bbc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfo9USVfTCZYRda1pYkzZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I found no hidden duplicates. I did not change anything.\n\n**What I checked:**\n- 148 active skills: your own skills, the skills from your plugins, and your claude.ai skills.\n- I compared every pair of descriptions to find similar wording.\n- I also compared the main text of every skill to find exact copies.\n\n**What I found:**\n\n1. **Same skill on claude.ai and on your machine (7 pairs). Already handled.**\n   - These are `closeout`, `dev-sync`, `new-project`, `five-slides-generator`, `articulation-skill`, `watch` and `last30days`.\n   - Each one also exists as a claude.ai copy, named `anthropic-skills:<name>`.\n   - All 7 claude.ai copies are already set to \"off\" in `~/.claude/settings.json`, so only your local or plugin copy runs.\n   - Do not delete them on claude.ai. They are the right copies when you use claude.ai itself.\n\n2. **Look alike, but do different jobs. Keep them.**\n   - `library-advisor` answers questions from your book library. `library-review` finds gaps in it.\n   - `startup` syncs the machine and tells you where you left off. `anthropic-skills:morning` makes a morning brief page.\n   - `grill-me` and `grill-with-docs`, and `handoff` and `claude-handoff`: Matt made each pair as two different versions on purpose.\n   - `chrome-browser`, `built-in-browser` and `computer-use` control different tools.\n\n**What you do now:** Nothing. With the 6 links I removed earlier, your skill list is clean."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1164,"cache_read_input_tokens":96000,"output_tokens":542,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":16},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","ca