{"parentUuid":"0eb47cdf-3da6-4b87-a2c5-387fa6149e35","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfo9ezmeKhpFz4UwoZJcZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I trimmed the code review skills. You now have 2 main ones, plus 1 that stays in the background.\n\n**What I kept:**\n- **`/code-review`** (built-in): your main review.\n- **`codex-review`**: Codex checks a plan. This is the only review skill you have actually used (4 times).\n\n**What I changed:**\n- **`mattpocock-skills:code-review`: turned off.** You never used it. It also starts several helper agents at once, which costs more usage.\n- **`superpowers:requesting-code-review`: turned down.** Its name stays in the list, but it no longer starts by itself. Two other superpowers skills call it (`subagent-driven-development` and `executing-plans`), so turning it fully off could break them.\n- I removed an old line that made the built-in `/code-review` show only its name, so it shows its full description again.\n\n**Saved:** I committed `~/.claude/settings.json` as `b3641cc` and pushed it. The commit also has the earlier Matt Pocock plugin switch. I did not open a second copy to test the change.\n\n**What you do now:**\n- Restart Claude Code.\n- On the Windows laptop, Matt's plugin may not be installed from Matt's own marketplace yet. If its skills are missing there, run `claude plugin install mattpocock-skills@mattpocock`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":401,"cache_read_input_tokens":100743,"output_tokens":509,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":77},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":401,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":509,"cache_read_input_tokens":100743,"cache_creation_input_tokens":401,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":401},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfo9ezVXr6GEWJnKbnUUp","type":"assistant","uuid":"9456c981-8e2b-43dd-a968-0c2a2ba6ec5d","timestamp":"2026-10-07T15:56:20.244Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4a9c3d55-7061-46f7-9760-4b5eacc869c5","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"4a9c3d55-7061-46f7-9760-4b5eacc869c5","version":"2.1.292","gitBranch":"main"}
